    {
      "number": "671",
      "text": "\u89e3\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n1) $5\\cdot(x-7)=3\\cdot(x-4)-27$\uff1b\n2) $4\\cdot(x-3)-16=5\\cdot(x-5)$\uff1b\n3) $3x+2\\cdot(2x-3)=8-7\\cdot(x-2)$\uff1b\n4) $3\\cdot(2x-5)+4x=5\\cdot(x-3)+27$.",
