      "number": "685",
      "text": "\u89e3\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n1) $-4\\cdot(3-5x)=18x-7$\uff1b\n2) $1.2-2\\cdot(1.3x+1)=5.6x-27.04$\uff1b\n3) $8\\cdot(2a-6)=2\\cdot(4a+3)$\uff1b\n4) $-3\\cdot(2.1m-1)+4.8=-6.7m+9.4$.",
